  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/i-statements> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/nonviolent-communication> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/i-statements> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/situation-behavior-impact> .
