  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/open-ended-questions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/follow-up-questions> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/open-ended-questions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/psychological-safety> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/open-ended-questions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/teach-back> .
