  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/batna> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#complements> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/first-offer> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/batna> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#demonstratedBy> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/brett-pinkley-jackofsky-1996> .
