  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/teach-back/s5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> "2026-11-03"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/teach-back/s5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> "Bodenheimer, Family Practice Management (American Academy of Family Physicians), July/August 2018, 20-22 (UCSF Center for Excellence in Primary Care copy)" .
