  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/william-strunk-jr> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Cornell English professor (1869-1946) whose 1918 classroom handbook, The Elements of Style, set out short imperative rules such as using the active voice and omitting needless words; revised by his former student E. B. White in 1959, it became the best-known American writing guide." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/william-strunk-jr> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/scheme/thinkers-and-works> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/william-strunk-jr> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "William Strunk Jr." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/william-strunk-jr> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/active-voice> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/william-strunk-jr> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/concise-writing> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/william-strunk-jr> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/effective-writing-for-army-leaders> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/william-strunk-jr> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/plain-language> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/william-strunk-jr> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/writing-style-guide> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/william-strunk-jr> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/william-strunk-jr/s1> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/william-strunk-jr> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/william-strunk-jr/s2> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/william-strunk-jr> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/william-strunk-jr/s3> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/william-strunk-jr> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/source/william-strunk-jr/s4> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/william-strunk-jr> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#authored> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/the-elements-of-style> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/william-strunk-jr> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#challengedBy> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/fifty-years-of-stupid-grammar-advice> .
